      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把每一个不等式换成与它同解的最简不等式，得到与原",
        "不等式组同解的不等式组："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x&>2,\\\\↵x&>3.6,\\\\↵x&<8.\\end{aligned}\\right.\\qquad(4)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "利用数轴求出它的解集合是数区间$]3.6,8[$（图19）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "答：$]3.6,8[$。"
      ]
    },
