      "lines": [
        "注意，因为不等式$x>2$能从不等式$x>3.6$推出，所以不等",
        "式组（4）的解可以归结为下列由两个不等式构成的不等式组",
        "的解：$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x&>3.6,\\\\↵x&<8.\\end{aligned}\\right.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们现在来讲二重不等式的解法。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例5 解二重不等式："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$-1<3-2x<3$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "给定的二重不等式是下列不等式组的另外一种表示法："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3-2x&>-1,\\\\↵3-2x&<3.\\end{aligned}\\right.$"
      ]
    },
